    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Maybe you needed money. Maybe you wanted a family, however questionable. Or maybe you simply get the job done by any means necessary. Whatever the reason, you joined the Zhentarim, the most infamous mercenary guild in the Realms. Its leaders claim the organization is more a family than a shadowy syndicate, but few families display as much deceit, nepotism, and corruption. You have sharpened your cunning, your reflexes, and your blade to rise through its ranks.</p><p><strong>Ability Scores:</strong> Strength, Dexterity, Charisma</p><p><strong>Feat:</strong> @UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.backgrounds-feats.Item.NugkjLqmQcivQC0z]{Zhentarim Ruffian}</p><p><strong>Skill Proficiencies:</strong> Intimidation and Perception</p><p><strong>Tool Proficiency:</strong> @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbtulForgeryKit]{Forgery Kit}</p><p><strong>Equipment:</strong> <em>Choose A or B:</em> (A) @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbwepClub000000]{Club}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbwepDagger0000]{Dagger}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbtulForgeryKit]{Forgery Kit}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagClothesFine]{Fine Clothes}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagLanternHood]{Hooded Lantern}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagOil00000000]{Oil} (3 flasks), 2 @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagPouch000000]{Pouches}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagString00000]{String}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagTinderbox00]{Tinderbox}, 11 GP; or (B) 50 GP</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
